### US-01 / US-02 · Pokémon live from PokeAPI (public)

### First page, default size (20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon

### Second page of 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon?page=1&size=5

### Page size above the maximum (100) — 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon?size=101

### Detailed view: Eevee (branched evolution chain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon/133

### Detailed view: Pikachu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon/25

### Unknown Pokémon — 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pokemon/999999
